### ============================================================
### LUCROM Studio AI — Testes Individuais de Serviço
### Arquivo: test/api.http  (use com REST Client do VS Code ou JetBrains)
### ============================================================
### Configure as variáveis abaixo antes de executar:
###   BASE_URL  — URL base da API (local ou staging)
###   TOKEN     — valor do API_TOKEN configurado no .env
### ============================================================

@BASE_URL = http://localhost:3000
@TOKEN = seu_api_token_aqui

### ─── 0. Health Check (sem autenticação) ───────────────────────────────────

GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/healthz

### ─── 1. Tenants ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Criar tenant CREATOR
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Loja Exemplo Ltda",
  "plan_tier": "CREATOR"
}

### Criar tenant ENTERPRISE
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rede Farmácias SA",
  "plan_tier": "ENTERPRISE"
}

### Listar todos os tenants
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Buscar tenant por ID (substitua o UUID abaixo)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ─── 2. Media Assets — Upload ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### Upload de vídeo bruto (multipart/form-data)
### Substitua TENANT_ID e ajuste o caminho do arquivo
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/media-assets/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tenant_id"

00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="raw_video.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./sample_video.mp4
------FormBoundary--

### Listar assets de um tenant
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/media-assets/tenant/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Buscar asset por ID e obter URL de download
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/media-assets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ─── 3. Consent Records ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Registrar consentimento de rosto
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/consent
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "subject_type": "face",
  "subject_name": "João Silva",
  "expires_at": "2027-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### Registrar consentimento de voz
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/consent
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "subject_type": "voice",
  "subject_name": "Maria Santos"
}

### Verificar consentimento válido
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/consent/check?tenant_id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&subject_type=face&subject_name=João%20Silva
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Listar consentimentos de um tenant
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/consent/tenant/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Revogar consentimento (substitua o UUID do consent)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/consent/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ─── 4. Engine M8 — Render ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Enfileirar render básico (sem etapas generativas)
### raw_video_key = s3_key retornado no upload acima
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/engines/m8/render
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "script_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099",
  "raw_video_key": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/upload/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "pipeline_options": {
    "subtitles_style": "none",
    "background_denoise": false
  },
  "script_text": "Conheça nossos produtos. Qualidade garantida. Venha nos visitar.",
  "brand_kit": {
    "palette": ["#FF5733", "#FFFFFF", "#333333"],
    "forbidden_words": ["concorrente", "barato"]
  }
}

### Enfileirar render com Audio Clean + Legendas (Etapa 1 + Etapa 4)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/engines/m8/render
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "script_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099",
  "raw_video_key": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/upload/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "pipeline_options": {
    "enable_audio_clean": true,
    "language": "pt",
    "subtitles_style": "word_level"
  },
  "script_text": "Bem-vindo à nossa farmácia. Atendimento humanizado todos os dias."
}

### Enfileirar render completo (todas as etapas — nicho marcenaria)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/engines/m8/render
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "script_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099",
  "raw_video_key": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/upload/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "pipeline_options": {
    "enable_audio_clean": true,
    "language": "pt",
    "enable_matting": true,
    "niche": "marcenaria",
    "subtitles_style": "word_level",
    "output_width": 1080,
    "output_height": 1920
  },
  "script_text": "Móveis sob medida com qualidade incomparável. Venha conhecer nosso showroom.",
  "brand_kit": {
    "palette": ["#8B4513", "#DEB887", "#FFFFFF"],
    "forbidden_words": []
  }
}

### Consultar status de um render job
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/engines/m8/render/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Listar render jobs de um tenant
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/engines/m8/render/tenant/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ─── 5. Quality Iterations ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Listar iterações do Quality Director para um render job
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/quality-iterations/render-job/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ─── 6. Audit Gate Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Logs de auditoria por asset
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/audit-gate-logs/asset/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Logs de auditoria por tenant (últimos 200)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/audit-gate-logs/tenant/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ─── 7. Script Generator (Lacuna 1) ────────────────────────────────────────

### Gerar roteiro/copy para Reels de farmácia
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/scripts/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "brief": "Promoção de vitamina D em dose alta, válida até o fim do mês, com desconto de 20% para quem apresentar este vídeo na farmácia.",
  "niche": "farmacia",
  "platform": "instagram_reels",
  "target_duration_seconds": 25,
  "forbidden_words": ["concorrente", "milagroso"]
}

### Buscar roteiro gerado por ID
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/scripts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000020
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Listar roteiros de um tenant
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/scripts/tenant/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ─── 8. Graphic Composer (Lacuna 2) ────────────────────────────────────────

### Compor carrossel de 3 slides (formato feed, 1080x1350)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/graphics/compose
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "kind": "carousel",
  "format": "1080x1350",
  "slides": [
    { "title": "Vitamina D em promoção", "body": "Dose alta, com acompanhamento farmacêutico gratuito.", "footer": "Farmácia Exemplo" },
    { "title": "20% de desconto", "body": "Apresente este post na loja até o fim do mês.", "footer": "Farmácia Exemplo" },
    { "title": "Fale com a gente", "body": "Chame no WhatsApp ou venha até a loja mais próxima.", "footer": "Farmácia Exemplo" }
  ],
  "brand_kit": {
    "palette": ["#0B6E4F", "#08A045", "#FFFFFF"],
    "font_family": "'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif"
  }
}

### Compor arte estática (formato story, 1080x1920)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/graphics/compose
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "kind": "static_art",
  "format": "1080x1920",
  "slides": [
    { "title": "Promoção relâmpago", "body": "20% OFF em vitamina D hoje.", "footer": "Farmácia Exemplo" }
  ],
  "brand_kit": {
    "palette": ["#0B6E4F", "#08A045", "#FFFFFF"]
  }
}

### Buscar composição gráfica por ID
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/graphics/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000030
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Listar composições gráficas de um tenant
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/graphics/tenant/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ─── 9. Voice Commands (Lacuna 3) ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Interpretar comando de voz (upload multipart do áudio)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/voice-commands/interpret
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tenant_id"

00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

pt
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="comando.webm"
Content-Type: audio/webm

< ./sample_command.webm
------FormBoundary--

### Buscar comando de voz interpretado por ID
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/voice-commands/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000040
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Listar comandos de voz de um tenant
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/voice-commands/tenant/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ─── 10. Motion Graphics (Lacuna 4) ────────────────────────────────────────

### Overlay de logo/selo (canto superior direito, com opacidade)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/engines/m8/motion-graphics/overlay
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "source_video_key": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/upload/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "overlay_image_key": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/upload/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000050",
  "position": "top_right",
  "opacity": 0.85,
  "scale_width": 220
}

### Lower third (nome + cargo, dos 2s aos 6s do vídeo)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/engines/m8/motion-graphics/lower-third
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "source_video_key": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/upload/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "title": "Dra. Ana Souza",
  "subtitle": "Farmacêutica responsável",
  "start_time": 2,
  "end_time": 6,
  "accent_color": "#08A045"
}

### Transição entre dois clipes (fade de 1s)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/engines/m8/motion-graphics/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "first_clip_key": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/upload/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "second_clip_key": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/upload/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000051",
  "transition": "fade",
  "duration_seconds": 1
}

